### T1 - Cadastro válido (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Carlos", "email": "carlos@tarefas.com", "password": "123456" }

### T2 - E-mail repetido (409)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Carlos", "email": "carlos@tarefas.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login ADMIN (200)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@tarefas.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login Ana (200)
# @name loginAna
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@tarefas.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login Bruno (200)
# @name loginBruno
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bruno@tarefas.com", "password": "123456" }

### T3 - Login com senha errada (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@tarefas.com", "password": "errada" }

### T4 - Rota protegida sem token (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Token com formato errado (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

### Token adulterado (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}x

### T5 - Rota protegida com token válido (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

### T6 - Ana cria tarefa mandando outro dono no body (201, dono = Ana)
# @name tarefaAna
POST http://localhost:3000/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

{ "titulo": "Tarefa da Ana", "userId": 999 }

### T7 - Bruno altera tarefa da Ana (403)
PUT http://localhost:3000/tarefas/{{tarefaAna.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBruno.response.body.token}}

{ "status": "CONCLUIDA" }

### Ana altera a própria tarefa (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/tarefas/{{tarefaAna.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

{ "status": "CONCLUIDA" }

### ADMIN altera tarefa da Ana (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/tarefas/{{tarefaAna.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "titulo": "Editada pelo admin" }

### T8 - USER em rota de ADMIN (403)
GET http://localhost:3000/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

### T9 - ADMIN em rota de ADMIN (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### ADMIN altera role com valor inválido (400)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/2/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "role": "SUPERUSER" }

### T10 - Recurso inexistente (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/tarefas/99999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

{ "status": "CONCLUIDA" }